      "id": "n1",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "[i]The sword is small, and plain, and a little crooked. It is warm, as if someone has only just let go of it.[/i]",
      "next": "n2"
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "[i]Far above the frozen flame, an old man is holding a hammer and does not know why. You know why now.[/i]",
      "next": "n3"
    },
